{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:25 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b117ee378636bd10176340dd0e250f42/2026-10/003_15.png\"/>\n<p>今日（18日）下午2時許，警方接獲報案，指一對70多歲的夫婦倒卧屯門山景邨景榮樓的寓所內，奄奄一息，救援人員趕到現場，發現二人已陷昏迷，旁邊有一盤已燒過的炭，隨即將他們送往屯門醫院搶救。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65741c05397ef1c7e59487b5f63ee393/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf03dc8eff03f929e65bfcd2a688a8f3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34f581674b6c675d4b1000b5ee248ca5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/715ca26c026b34f64c6587d1e0fba6c9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cb5542e7091ee494366e023526e2832/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/426cbf90ab03c244201355df82037cdf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_12_36.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:58:31.549707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:25:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:35.258266+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:35.258266+00:00","content_hash":"d086edb3c64ed741657f8bd70f15609207d98949620d36a6b7b2910a57c48fe2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}